# The desk: computer setup, table and chair. Creator Store model 524440363
# ("Computer set up and Table w/ Chair!" by MALDING_XD).
#
# Same format and pipeline as apartment.psv -- build_place.py turns it into
# ReplicatedStorage.DeskTemplate and HomeService clones one per base. Extracted
# rather than referenced for the same reason the apartment is: a Studio-inserted
# model only survives a rebuild if it lives in assets/.
#
# Coordinates are RELATIVE to the centre of the footprint at ground level.
#
# STRAIGHTENED ON THE WAY IN. The asset ships at a 29 degree yaw baked into all
# 97 parts. Left in, every consumer would have to know to cancel it, so the rig
# was rotated by -29.05 about its pivot before extraction and the numbers here
# are axis-aligned -- which is why they are round.
#
# ORIENTATION: the desk top runs along Z at x=+1.5, the chair sits at x=-2.5.
# You approach the rig from its -X side. HomeService aims that side at the door.
#
# The chair was a Seat and is emitted as a plain Part. A Seat grabs anyone who
# brushes past it, and this one stands in the walkway to the collect ring.
#
# class|name|size|pos|rot(9)|color|material|transparency|meshId|textureId|nativeSize
